+# Reboot — Working Files
+
+A from-scratch rebuild of *A God in the Garden*. **Not** a revision of the material in `/isekai`.
+
+## Status
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Old project | Archived. Reference only — a quarry for names and individual scenes, nothing more. |
+| Old manuscripts | Do not exist. Nothing to salvage at prose level. |
+| Mode | **Plan thoroughly, then draft.** |
+| Decisions locked | A+C engine · exile load-bearing · 5 volumes · one romance lane (Seraine) · no inherited Hollow · no First Watch |
+| Signature set piece | **The Council Beat** — the enemy's leadership in a room, Casian in the corner unnoticed, then he speaks |
+| Ages | Generated from `canon/characters.json` → `canon/ages.md`. Never written from memory. |
+
+## What's here
+
+- `00_discussion.md` — the diagnosis and the argument that led to the reboot.
+- `canon/bible.md` — premise, the Current, Argius, the exile, the Keeping, character and knowledge locks.
+- `canon/constitution.md` — the law. Rewritten for the new engine; several rules are new.
+- `canon/series_arc.md` — five volumes, each a different *kind* of story.
+- `canon/roster.txt` — canonical names, ages, roles. **Generated** — do not edit.
+- `canon/ages.md` — age of every character in every volume. **Generated** — do not edit.
+- `canon/characters.json` — the single source of truth for names, ages, and the calendar. Edit this.
+- `tools/age_ledger.py` — regenerates the two above; `--check` verifies, `--check-year` audits chapters.
+
+## Next, in order
+
+1. Volume 1 chapter-level plan (40 beats, sentence-per-beat, no scenes written yet).
+2. Read-through and argument — I'd rather you break the chapter plan before prose.
+3. Draft volume 1.
+4. Extend the chapter plan only as drafting catches up. **Never plan volume 5 before drafting volume 1.** That is precisely what killed the last version.
+
+## The one-line pitch, for reference
+
+> A homesick god builds a place so safe that it stops needing him — and discovers he doesn't know how to be unnecessary.
